n available to both children;\n- no source/material allowlists;\n- Standards and Spec remain distinct questions;\n- do not edit or depend on changing the global Skill;\n- do not parse/sanitize child report prose, add replacement legs, or weaken verbatim preservation;\n- canonical semantic content remains input, while package recipe owns transport/output mechanics.\n\nConsider axis-specific compiled output envelopes/instructions that supersede the dual-axis presentation template for each fixed question while preserving semantic brief content, and align semantic audit with that lawful envelope. Escalate only if a genuine major owner choice remains; otherwise authorize direct Fixer classes. No code edits or Plan. Submit via `ak_judge_output`."
